                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Healthcare costs have never been higher.\n\nToday is the final day to sign up for ACA coverage that kicks in January 1st, and House Republicans still won't join us to extend the tax credits that help tens of millions of Americans afford health insurance.\n\nWhat are they waiting for?",
