                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Extending the ACA tax credits is the only realistic way to lower premiums and protect health coverage for working families.\n\nFour Republicans chose people over politics and joined Democrats to demand a vote. Unfortunately, none of my Republican colleagues from Arizona did so.",
